  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till skatteorganisationen ICEFI fas II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the tax organisation ICEFI phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l omfattar att underl&#xe4;tta konvergens som    skall leda till politiska och sociala &#xf6;verenskommelser som till&#xe5;ter   grundandet av solida fiskala policies och reformer som &#xe4;r i linje med str&#xe4;van hos en majoritet av Guatemalas befolkning f&#xf6;r den typ av stat de vill ha.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is, through institutional support to the Central   American Institute for Fiscal Studies (ICEFI), to facilitate          covergences that will lead to to social and political treaties or     agreements that will permit the establishment of solid fiscal         policies that concur with the aspiration of a majority of the         Guatemalan population on what kind of state they want.</narrative>
  </description>
